sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Claude as Claude<br/>(Conversation)
    participant MCPClient as MCP Client<br/>(Claude-side)
    participant MCPServer as MCP Server<br/>(Imagine)
    participant Host as Host UI<br/>(Claude Chat)
    participant Browser as Browser DOM

    User->>Claude: "Create an interactive<br/>compound interest calculator"
    
    activate Claude
    Claude->>Claude: Analyze request<br/>Generate HTML/CSS/JS<br/>~2,500 tokens
    Claude->>MCPClient: Call visualize:show_widget<br/>with widget_code parameter<br/>(HTML string)
    deactivate Claude

    activate MCPClient
    MCPClient->>MCPServer: Tool call: visualize:show_widget<br/>Payload: HTML/CSS/JS code<br/>(~2.5KB compressed)
    deactivate MCPClient

    activate MCPServer
    MCPServer->>MCPServer: Parse tool call<br/>Cache widget_code<br/>Generate resource URI
    MCPServer->>Host: Return resource URI<br/>+ widget_code
    deactivate MCPServer

    activate Host
    Host->>Host: Inject CSS variables<br/>--text-primary, --surface-1, etc.
    Host->>Browser: Parse HTML<br/>Apply CSS<br/>Attach event listeners
    Host->>Browser: Render widget DOM
    deactivate Host

    Browser->>User: Display interactive widget<br/>3 sliders + chart + value cards

    activate User
    User->>Browser: Move principal slider<br/>from $1,000 to $5,000
    deactivate User

    activate Browser
    Browser->>Browser: onchange event fires<br/>JavaScript runs client-side<br/>ZERO API calls
    Browser->>Browser: Recalculate:<br/>balance = P × (1+r)^y<br/>compound = $38,060<br/>simple = $15,500
    Browser->>Browser: Update DOM:<br/>- Output labels<br/>- Value cards<br/>- Chart data
    Browser->>Browser: Re-render Chart.js
    deactivate Browser

    Browser->>User: Display updated results<br/>Real-time, instant

    User->>Browser: Adjust rate slider<br/>from 7% to 10%
    
    activate Browser
    Browser->>Browser: onchange fires<br/>Recalculate & re-render<br/>(0 tokens)
    deactivate Browser

    Browser->>User: Display updated chart

    User->>Claude: "Add monthly<br/>compounding toggle"
    
    activate Claude
    Claude->>Claude: Analyze request<br/>Regenerate HTML with:<br/>- Toggle buttons<br/>- Monthly formula logic<br/>~3,200 tokens
    Claude->>MCPClient: Call visualize:show_widget<br/>with NEW widget_code
    deactivate Claude

    activate MCPClient
    MCPClient->>MCPServer: Tool call with<br/>updated widget_code
    deactivate MCPClient

    activate MCPServer
    MCPServer->>Host: Return updated widget
    deactivate MCPServer

    activate Host
    Host->>Browser: Replace widget DOM<br/>New version cached
    deactivate Host

    Browser->>User: Display updated widget<br/>with toggle buttons

    activate User
    User->>Browser: Click "Monthly" button
    deactivate User

    activate Browser
    Browser->>Browser: Button click handler<br/>Set isMonthly = true<br/>Recalculate with:<br/>balance = P × (1 + r/12)^(12×y)
    Browser->>Browser: Update label to<br/>"Compound Interest (Monthly)"<br/>Re-render chart
    deactivate Browser

    Browser->>User: Show monthly results<br/>(0 tokens for interaction)

    activate User
    User->>Browser: Toggle to "Annually"
    deactivate User

    activate Browser
    Browser->>Browser: Button click handler<br/>Recalculate with annual formula<br/>Update DOM (0 tokens)
    deactivate Browser

    Browser->>User: Show annual results

    Note over User,Browser: Token Cost Summary: Initial widget 2,500T (one-time) | User interactions 0T (unlimited) | Update 3,200T | Toggles 0T | Total ~5,700T vs 7,500-15,000T with API-per-interaction
